{"id":"n-20261015-v708p7","category":"gaming","display_title":"S&box Faces Major Overhaul","display_title_he":"ס&בוקס עומד בפני שינוי מקיף","short_summary":"Following a disappointing launch, the creator of Garry's Mod announced sweeping changes to turn around the spiritual successor S&box.","english_level":"C1","words":461,"reading_time":3,"image":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/Yamaha_k-1d_face.jpg/960px-Yamaha_k-1d_face.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Retired electrician · CC0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yamaha_k-1d_face.jpg"},"sources":[{"name":"Polygon","domain":"polygon.com","url":"https://www.polygon.com/garrys-mod-creator-sbox-spiritual-sequel-dire-update","title":"'Garry’s Mod' Creator Issues Dire Update on Spiritual Sequel: ‘It Hasn’t Been Going Well’","published_at":"2026-10-15T02:02:11.000Z"}],"published_at":"2026-10-15T02:02:11.000Z","first_published_in_app_at":"2026-10-15T06:11:21.345Z","quality_score":9,"interest_score":8,"verification_status":"verified","content_status":"published","paragraphs":["Garry Newman, the mastermind behind the immensely popular physics sandbox Garry’s Mod, has issued a candid and exceptionally critical update regarding his development studio’s spiritual successor, S&box. According to a frank blog post published by Newman, the project has struggled significantly since its April launch, failing to resonate with players or maintain healthy user retention rates across the platform. S&box currently sits at roughly 47 percent positive reviews on Steam, a disheartening statistic that Newman openly described as both embarrassing and shameful for the entire team at Facepunch Studios.","Developed using Valve’s advanced Source 2 engine, S&box was intended to follow closely in the footsteps of Garry’s Mod, a phenomenal success that has sold more than 25 million copies worldwide. However, Newman explained that the studio made critical missteps during the development cycle, focusing far too heavily on backend creation tools rather than the actual gameplay experience delivered to players. Because they were essentially selling an engine instead of a completed game, their initial vision missed the mark completely and alienated prospective users.","To reverse this downward trajectory, Facepunch Studios plans to implement a series of sweeping structural changes. The team will pivot to prioritize the core sandbox experience, introducing more non-player characters and vehicles while concurrently upgrading multiplayer functionality, customization options, and add-on support. The ultimate objective is to bring S&box up to structural parity with its legendary predecessor and eventually surpass it entirely.","Furthermore, the studio is completely overhauling how users discover content within the platform. Newman noted that his initial concept of a curated streaming library akin to a service for games did not function as intended. An influx of low-quality submissions, including a troubling wave of automated AI-generated projects, flooded the platform and made it exceptionally difficult for users to find worthwhile experiences. Moving forward, Facepunch intends to emphasize strict curation to highlight the finest community creations and transition its technical infrastructure to utilize Steam Workshop instead of proprietary alternatives.","In perhaps the most notable economic shift, S&box is slated to transition into a free-to-play title near the end of 2026. Newman explicitly acknowledged that charging an upfront entry fee alongside paid cosmetic items likely discouraged potential users from trying the platform out. To reward early supporters, existing owners will receive exclusive Steam inventory items when the game adopts the free-to-play model, with bonus rewards designated for those who paid the higher tier price rather than the discounted rate.","Newman concluded his comprehensive update by thanking the community for their ongoing patience and acknowledging the widespread frustration surrounding the project. While expressing deep affection for the Source 2 engine and its immense creative potential, he stressed that the team fully understands why users felt let down and asked for continued support while these substantial transformations take effect."],"facts":[{"fact":"Garry Newman admitted that Facepunch Studios' spiritual successor S&box is struggling and announced sweeping changes.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"S&box launched in April and failed to win over players, holding roughly 47% positive Steam reviews and poor retention.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Facepunch focused too heavily on tools rather than the player experience, failing to match Garry's Mod success of over 25 million copies.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"The studio plans to prioritize core sandbox gameplay, add NPCs, vehicles, multiplayer improvements, and better customization.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Facepunch is abandoning its 'Netflix for games' curation model due to an abundance of low-quality and AI-generated projects.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"S&box will integrate Steam Workshop infrastructure and is expected to become free-to-play toward the end of 2026.","sources":[1]}],"glossary":[{"text":"Garry Newman","lemma":"Garry Newman","pos":"proper noun","he":"גארי נומן","name":true},{"text":"mastermind","lemma":"mastermind","pos":"noun","he":"מוח מתכנן","name":false},{"text":"behind","lemma":"behind","pos":"preposition","he":"מאחורי","name":false},{"text":"immensely","lemma":"immensely","pos":"adverb","he":"באופן עצום","name":false},{"text":"popular","lemma":"popular","pos":"adjective","he":"פופולארי","name":false},{"text":"physics sandbox","lemma":"physics sandbox","pos":"noun","he":"ארגז חול פיזיקלי","name":false},{"text":"Garry’s Mod","lemma":"Garry's Mod","pos":"proper noun","he":"גאריז מוד","name":true},{"text":"issued","lemma":"issue","pos":"verb","he":"הוציא, פרסם","name":false},{"text":"candid","lemma":"candid","pos":"adjective","he":"כני, גלוי","name":false},{"text":"exceptionally","lemma":"exceptionally","pos":"adverb","he":"באופן יוצא מן הכלל","name":false},{"text":"critical","lemma":"critical","pos":"adjective","he":"קירטי, מבקר","name":false},{"text":"update","lemma":"update","pos":"noun","he":"עדכון","name":false},{"text":"development studio","lemma":"development studio","pos":"noun","he":"סטודיו פיתוח","name":false},{"text":"spiritual successor","lemma":"spiritual successor","pos":"noun","he":"יורש רוחני","name":false},{"text":"S&box","lemma":"S&box","pos":"proper noun","he":"אס-אנד-בוקס","name":true},{"text":"frank","lemma":"frank","pos":"adjective","he":"כני","name":false},{"text":"blog post","lemma":"blog post","pos":"noun","he":"פוסט בבלוג","name":false},{"text":"published","lemma":"publish","pos":"verb","he":"פרסם","name":false},{"text":"project","lemma":"project","pos":"noun","he":"פרויקט","name":false},{"text":"struggled","lemma":"struggle","pos":"verb","he":"התקשה","name":false},{"text":"significantly","lemma":"significantly","pos":"adverb","he":"באופן משמעותי","name":false},{"text":"launch","lemma":"launch","pos":"noun","he":"השקה","name":false},{"text":"failing","lemma":"fail","pos":"verb","he":"נכשל","name":false},{"text":"resonate","lemma":"resonate","pos":"verb","he":"להתחבר, לקלוע","name":false},{"text":"maintain","lemma":"maintain","pos":"verb","he":"לשמור","name":false},{"text":"retention rates","lemma":"retention rate","pos":"noun","he":"שיעורי שימור","name":false},{"text":"platform","lemma":"platform","pos":"noun","he":"פלטפורמה","name":false},{"text":"Steam","lemma":"Steam","pos":"proper noun","he":"סטים","name":true},{"text":"disheartening","lemma":"disheartening","pos":"adjective","he":"מיאץ","name":false},{"text":"statistic","lemma":"statistic","pos":"noun","he":"סטטיסטיקה","name":false},{"text":"openly","lemma":"openly","pos":"adverb","he":"בגלוי","name":false},{"text":"embarrassing","lemma":"embarrassing","pos":"adjective